{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_048590","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"唉……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"怎么了，Chico？叹什么气，不像你啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":50,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"啊，Snake。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":14,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"有烦心事吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"诶？也没什么……倒也不是完全没有吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"喂，Snake……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":20,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"怎么？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"女孩子真奇怪。搞不懂她们在想什么，又总是随心所欲。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"果然和男人不一样吗……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"……怎么突然说这个。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"Chico……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":14,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"你是不是有喜欢的<R=女孩,人>了？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=女孩,人>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":44,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_LOCALIZED"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"才、才不是！只是……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"只是什么？要是愿意，我可以听你说。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"……我一跟Paz说话，就莫名心跳得厉害，话也说不好。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"Paz？也是，你们年龄差不多。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"Snake你以前也有过这种事吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":38,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"有啊。谁都会有。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"要怎么才能跟她好好说话呢？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"……难啊。别太在意，像平时一样不就好了？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"可我就是做不到。一到Paz面前，身体就僵住了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"跟Paz一对上眼，不知怎么脸就发烫……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"只能习惯。跟战场一样。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"一开始会紧张，但经历多了自然就习惯了。努力多跟她说说话吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"嗯、嗯……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"可是，女孩子比<R=未确认动物,UMA>还充满谜团啊……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=未确认动物,UMA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"确实。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""}]}